scope_notes='Planning equivalents on the existing Claude-point scale, not measured Codex cost or calendar promises. Small findings share removable layers rather than separate point charges. Without FT-24/FT-28, 15a’s centre estimate is 15. Work order: this audit → approve 8b scope → 8b → book reading/8c → separately approve 15a/15b starts → device fixes → reassessment. FT-16 remains its own later catalogue cycle. Audit completion does not approve a build or merge.'
